# Backend (Go)

Read `.kiro/steering/tech.md` first.

- Services under `cmd/*`; shared logic in `internal/*`. Chi routers, pgx, Redis, slog.
- Browser/API boundary: **`http://localhost:8090`** via Caddy — not raw container ports.
- Env-driven config only; never hardcode secrets, tokens, or hostnames.
- Bounded queues, context cancellation, retry caps on upstream loops.
- **Symbol lookup:** `streamclone-codegraph` MCP (`get_ast_chunk`, `get_blast_radius`) — not Repomix.
- **Runtime truth:** `make context-snapshots` or MCP `stack_health` / `postgres_query` (SELECT only).
- Tests: `go test ./internal/<pkg>/...` before `make check-quick`.

Do **not** re-add `cmd/analytics` or `internal/analytics`. For StreamPulse BFF work, use private **streampulse-backend** — see [docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md](../../docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md).
